<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-BROKERAGE HOUSES PLAN INVESTMENT FUNDS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-BROKERAGE HOUSES PLAN INVESTMENT FUNDS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's top three brokerages said on Monday they are planning to launch investment funds, maybe this year, but two cite tax issues as their main worry.</p>
</text>
